#: apps/datalog/main/dl_edit.c:396
No hay sensores I2C. Los conocidos se reconocen solos en i2c.ext (SDA GPIO21, SCL GPIO22); los pocos que no se pueden reconocer sin riesgo (PCF8591, PCF8574, LM75…) se declaran en Módulos.	No I2C sensors. The known ones are recognised by themselves on i2c.ext (SDA GPIO21, SCL GPIO22); the few that cannot be recognised safely (PCF8591, PCF8574, LM75…) are declared in Modules.

#: apps/datalog/main/dl_edit.c:397
No hay sensores SPI. Una termocupla (MAX6675, MAX31855), una PT100 (MAX31865) o un MCP3008 se declaran en Módulos (Puertos, Agregar): el puerto spi.a y su CS.	No SPI sensors. A thermocouple (MAX6675, MAX31855), a PT100 (MAX31865) or an MCP3008 is declared in Modules (Ports, Add): the spi.a port and its CS.

#: apps/datalog/main/dl_edit.c:398
No hay sensores de pines. Un DHT22, un HC-SR04, una balanza HX711, un caudalímetro o un PIR se declaran en Módulos (Puertos, Agregar): se eligen sus pines.	No pin sensors. A DHT22, an HC-SR04, an HX711 scale, a flow meter or a PIR is declared in Modules (Ports, Add): you choose its pins.

#: apps/datalog/main/dl_edit.c:399
No hay sensores por puerto serie. Un MH-Z19, un PMS5003, un PZEM-004T o un radar LD2410 se declaran en Módulos (Puertos, Agregar), en uart.a.	No serial sensors. An MH-Z19, a PMS5003, a PZEM-004T or an LD2410 radar is declared in Modules (Ports, Add), on uart.a.

#: apps/datalog/main/dl_edit.c:400
No hay sensores 1-Wire. Un bus de DS18B20 se declara en Módulos (Puertos, Agregar, DS18B20): se elige el pin.	No 1-Wire sensors. A bus of DS18B20s is declared in Modules (Ports, Add, DS18B20): you pick the pin.

